  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "神秘方块持续喷出资源，石头村民分别负责击打、捡币与维持部落运转",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "At the center of the island stands a mysterious cube that constantly spits out resources. Before long, an entire stone tribe begins revolving around it in a frenzy. Some villagers punch the cube. Others run around collecting the coins and resources scattered everywhere. And your job is to keep the whole tribe growing.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3561030/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "方块升级会让资源循环逐渐失稳，必须持续调整技能、职业与成长路径保持效率",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "As the cube levels up, the resource cycle gradually becomes unstable. You’ll need to continuously adjust skills, professions, and growth paths to keep the entire system running efficiently.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3561030/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "职业与技能构筑叠加天赋、神殿祝福和季节挑战，最终形成满屏资源爆发",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The Stone Tribe As the game progresses, you’ll gradually unlock: More professions and skill builds Talent combinations and temple blessings Seasonal island challenges and growth rewards Increasingly absurd numbers and screen-filling effects",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3561030/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
